    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "They are equally selfish, working only for the benefit of themselves, but the relevant self that they defend is bigger in terms of space, time, and complexity. As will be argued below, what defines this Self is the boundary of information being able to pass between the subunits." ;
